--[[
    Retro Anim Changer (EXPERIMENTAL)
    By B00mz

    Different method from the normal version:
    instead of freezing your joints locally, this freezes your AnimationTracks
    (speed 0) and manually jumps their TimePosition forward every `delay` seconds.
    Because it changes the tracks themselves, it MIGHT replicate to other
    players in some games. Results vary per game, so test with a friend/alt.

    Notes:
    - Turning the effect OFF (or setting delay to 0) gives every track its
      normal speed back.
    - One-shot animations (attacks, emotes) are released near their end so
      they can finish normally instead of getting stuck.
    - Running this replaces the normal version (and vice versa).
]]

local Players = game:GetService("Players")
